All bugs across `src/auth.py`, `src/inventory.py`, and `src/text_utils.py` have been fixed. Every test in the test suite now passes successfully.

Here is a summary of the corrected issues:
- **`src/auth.py`**: Fixed case insensitivity in `has_permission` (`any(role.lower() == required_lower)`) and corrected the logical connector in `is_admin_or_owner` from `and` to `or` (`src/auth.py:16`).
